      "original_text": "Before the operational flip, an end-to-end PR-mode merge is exercised on this repo (a no-op test commit) \u2014 confirms that epic 4e55-a6ba's merge-to-main-pr.sh works correctly on this specific repo's configuration before local enforcement is turned off.",
